{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29115","headline":"颍州从事西湖亭讌饯 · 许浑","name":"颍州从事西湖亭讌饯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西湖清宴不知回，一曲离歌酒一杯。\n城带夕阳闻鼓角，寺临秋水见楼台。\n兰堂客散蝉犹噪，桂檝人稀鸟自来。\n独想征车过巩洛，此中霜菊遶潭开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}